- **`lib/`:** Troy Goode holds at least half.
- **`test/`:** nobody holds half. Troy Goode is closest at 46.9%.
- **`.github/`:** nobody holds half. Wilson has the most lines (108), but he is not close to half.
- **Root files:** nobody holds half. In `README.md`, Troy Goode has 116 lines and Jon Church has 72. Wilson leads `package.json`, `HISTORY.md`, `.eslintrc.yml` and `LICENSE`, but that is not enough to give him half of the root total.

